      "writtenOn": "2024-12-17T21:35:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should be updating connection interval for service discovery only initial connection parameters were not aggressive.\nIn other words, service discovery connection parameters must be same as initial aggressive connection parameters.",
      "revId": "7671e30bd7d5df176464d887002bb0d540c42ca9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f265c293_bbc06356",
